This orchestrator integrates multiple TARVIA-lab repositories (variant calling,
RNA-seq analysis, LLM interpretation, benchmarking, drug discovery) which may
have their own licenses and terms.

When deploying this orchestrator, ensure compliance with all downstream repo
licenses and API terms (Anthropic API, NCBI services, PDB access, etc.).
